    verification parserRatchetRetroGate : Test { :>> id = "dbfaee62-d343-441c-b54a-7d1adb00a7c9"; :>> title = "Sprint 428 retro gate (autonomous, D0049)"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-23"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::analyze; :>> procedureText = "Autonomous retro (D0049). AVOIDABLE-ISSUE SCAN under rcRecurrence: the count-can-grow-silently class now has TWO instances closed by the same ratchet pattern (this and the never-one-number discipline) - pattern named for reuse: any census a guard reports should either bound or explain why not. WELL: panel finding to landed fence in one sitting, with both the detection (ratchet) and prevention (generation) halves shipped together. Estimate 1 pt, delivered 1."; }
